Recommends: librescrs-agent (>= 5.0)
Description: Cross-platform reader and signer for LibreSCRS smart cards
 LibreCelik reads Serbian government smart cards -- identity, vehicle and
 health -- as well as generic ICAO electronic travel documents, NIST PIV cards
 and PKCS#15 cards, and signs documents in PAdES, XAdES and CAdES.
 .
 It talks to the card through the LibreSCRS agent, so the PIN is collected by
 the agent's own prompter rather than inside this application. Without the
 agent installed it starts and says so.
